# The SQLMesh fixture's checked-in export (.erd-studio/sqlmesh.json) records the
# SHA-256 of every source file in that project. A CRLF checkout would change those
# bytes and make every JavaScript test see the export as stale, so these files are
# always checked out with LF regardless of core.autocrlf.
test/fixtures/sqlmesh-project/** text eol=lf
